/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Life\040cycle\040assessment\040of\040aquaculture\040bivalve\040shellfish\040production\040\204\040a\040critical\040review\040of\040methodological\040trends)
/Author (Johan\055Andrés\040Vélez\055Henao\054\040Franz\040Weinland\054\040Norbert\040Reintjes)
/Subject (The\040increase\040of\040shellfish\040production\040has\040raised\040environmental\040concerns\054\040i\056e\056\054\040enrichment\040and\040redistribution\040of\040nutrients\040and\040energy\040consumption\056\040Efforts\040assessing\040the\040environmental\040burdens\040arising\040from\040the\040expansion\040of\040shellfish\040production\040have\040been\040made\040using\040the\040life\040cycle\040assessment\040\050LCA\051\040methodology\056\040Although\040LCA\040has\040been\040extensively\040applied\040and\040reviewed\040in\040aquaculture\040systems\054\040shellfish\040production\040remains\040scarcely\040studied\056\040The\040objective\040of\040this\040review\040is\040to\040identify\040methodological\040trends\054\040highlight\040gaps\040and\040limitations\054\040and\040provide\040guidelines\040for\040future\040studies\056\040A\040systematic\040literature\040review\040was\040applied\040to\040scientific\040studies\040published\040up\040to\0402021\056\040A\040total\040of\04013\040documents\040were\040shorted\040by\040abstract\040and\040full\040text\055screening\056\040Literature\040meeting\040the\040inclusion\040criteria\040were\040further\040analyzed\040in\040six\040different\040aspects\040of\040a\040LCA\040\050functional\040unit\054\040system\040boundaries\054\040data\040and\040data\040quality\054\040allocation\054\040impact\040assessment\040methods\054\040interpretation\040methods\051\056\040Discussion\040and\040guidelines\040are\040provided\040for\040each\040reviewed\040aspect\056\040Shellfish\040LCAs\040differ\040considerably\040from\040other\040aquaculture\040studies\040mainly\040because\040shellfish\040avoids\040the\040allocation\040of\040impacts\040derived\040from\040the\040production\040of\040fishmeal\056\040Co\055products\040are\040present\040when\040the\040shellfish\040is\040processed\054\040e\056g\056\054\040in\040canned\040products\056\040Furthermore\054\040shellfish\040studies\040do\040not\040take\040into\040account\040the\040positive\040credits\040from\040the\040removal\040of\040nutrients\040from\040the\040ecosystems\040and\040from\040the\040valorization\040of\040the\040shellfish\040waste\040\050shell\040and\040organic\040remains\051\056\040Limited\040information\040was\040found\040for\040countries\040outside\040Europe\040and\040species\040different\040from\040mussels\056\040Despite\040the\040variability\040on\040goals\040and\040scopes\040of\040the\040studies\054\040methodological\040trends\040were\040found\056\040The\040local\040impacts\040of\040the\040shellfish\040with\040the\040farming\040area\040and\040the\040impacts\040on\040biodiversity\040have\040not\040been\040included\040into\040the\040studies\056\040Effort\040should\040be\040made\040in\040providing\040the\040data\040associated\040with\040the\040fore\055background\040system\040within\040the\040studies\040in\040order\040to\040improve\040transparency\040and\040to\040allow\040the\040reproduction\040of\040the\040results\056\040Information\040regarding\040the\040natural\040condition\040of\040the\040cultivation\040area\040should\040be\040provided\040as\040the\040shellfish\040production\040depends\040mainly\040on\040non\055anthropogenic\040conditions\056\040Application\040of\040biodiversity\040assessment\040methodologies\040should\040be\040encouraged\054\040despite\040their\040limitations\056)
/Keywords (30\040Sep\0402021\054\040International\040Journal\040of\040Life\040Cycle\040Assessment)
>>
endobj
